# Never ship local dev artifacts: a stray public/hot makes Laravel's @vite
# emit dev-server URLs (http://[::1]:5173/...) in production, so the page
# renders blank. public/storage is a symlink to a machine-local path.
public/hot
public/storage
.vercel
